--
^warning: ignoring
static assertion failed
--
Class template instantiation expanded folds only in the class body.  A
fold left in a base-specifier reached the C type checker's placeholder and
became `true'; over a one-element pack, a fold in a base or an alias member
was left in place too.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this program, and it
fails only its WRONG assertion.
